{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S01、S06、S13 等段落的纵向交替和密集感受提示仍有阅读负担，X 的左右分栏和短词排列更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"整体选 Y，因为它把人物从离开后的失落、怀念与不甘，到对孤独的恐惧、对回归的犹疑，再到接受矛盾并继续生活的心理过程串得更完整，关键转折也有明显强调。尤其是感受与音乐段落同步出现，能让观众听见具体的情绪变化，而不只是看到几个笼统的情绪标签；X 虽然更容易扫读，但部分细腻变化被压缩，甚至不同阶段的感受容易堆在一起。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37800254-6ed7-4a26-b2b7-9973cf884edb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154829320438Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:49:29.330995+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b6bea61cf8724fad6596eda24344cfb601fe3fe326903e23a9679ea32a65570d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":